; Bank $1B symbol map -- Project / File / Help screens + UI text.
; See docs/editors.md and docs/sync.md. First-pass carve: the major string
; tables are marked as data in the disasm command; some embedded graphics/jump
; tables are still shown as code (byte-safe) and will be refined.

4A62 DrawHelpScreen   ; Help screen (idx 14): renders the help/command-list text
5C17 DrawProjectScreen ; Project screen draw: edits song-global properties at SRAM bank1 $BFB2+ (song offset $3FB2: tempo/transpose/sync/font/colorset/clone; see data_model.md)
58B1 DrawSyncField   ; Project SYNC field: read $CB66, draw mode string to VRAM $9885
59B7 SyncModeNames   ; sync-mode display names "OFF"/"LSDJ"/"MIDI"/... (7-byte stride)
5D4F CloneModeNames  ; clone-mode display names "DEEP"/"SLIM" (5-byte stride)
5B7A DrawSyncSubSetting ; draw PS/2 DELAY (KEYBD) or TICKS/STEP (analog) value beside SYNC
5126 ProjBanked_5126        ; banked-call wrapper (2x)

; --- context-based names (callee-derived role; Func/Proc = purpose TBD) ---
